{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんはー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、今日と二日間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋個握\n京都全握"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事に終了しましたー!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もたくさんの方々が会いに来て下さって、とても楽しかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2012/12/24/4437598/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2012/12/24/4437598/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の服は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2012/12/24/4437598/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい；\n撮り方が下手くそだから\n全然わからん写メだー。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が見てもわからないから\n皆さんもわからないと思うσ(*´∀｀*)エヘヘ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にしては珍しく薄ピンクのワンピース"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つけ襟風の襟とスカート裾には\n黒のバラが沢山付いてるんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2012/12/24/4437598/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はノースリーブで一枚でサラッと着るのが可愛いんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いのダメだから、見事に負けました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2012/12/24/4437598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上に着た黒カーディガンは、黒レースになってます♪\n見えないけど......；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今日の全握は初京都!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンは大好き美雲と♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2012/12/24/4437598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みくも終始テンション高すぎ((笑\nすっごい楽しかったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2012/12/24/4437598/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都、雪降ってたみたいだけど\n来て下さった皆さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"交通機関大丈夫でしたか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手の時も、みんな手が冷たくなっていたし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くれぐれも風邪ひかないでくださいね!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手は今年最後だったけれど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2013年も新年早々バンバン\n握手会があるので、是非遊びに来てくださいね〜"}],"source":"archive"}